< Access-Network-Charging-Identifier > ::= < AVP-Header: 502 >
{ Access-Network-Charging-Identifier-Value}
*[ Flows ]

< Flow-Grouping > ::= < AVP-Header: 508 >
*[Flows]

< Flows > ::= < AVP-Header: x >
{ Media-Component-Number}
*[ Flow-Number]

< Media-Component-Description > ::= < AVP-Header: 517 >
{ Media-Component-Number } ; Ordinal number of the media comp.
*[ Media-Sub-Component ] ; Set of flows for one flow identifier
[ AF-Application-Identifier ]
[ Media-Type ]
[ Max-Requested-Bandwidth-UL ]
[ Max-Requested-Bandwidth-DL ]
[ Flow-Status ]
[ RS-Bandwidth ]
[ RR-Bandwidth ]

< Media-Sub-Component > ::= < AVP-Header: 519 >
{ Flow-Number } ; Ordinal number of the IP flow
0*2[ Flow-Description ] ; UL and/or DL
[ Flow-Status ]
[ Flow-Usage ]
[ Max-Requested-Bandwidth-UL ]
[ Max-Requested-Bandwidth-DL ]

The Session-Abort-Cause AVP (AVP code 500) is of type Enumerated
The Access-Network-Charging-Address AVP (AVP code 501) is of type Address
The Access-Network-Charging-Identifier AVP (AVP code 502) is of type Grouped
The Access-Network-Charging-Identifier-Value AVP (AVP code 503) is of type OctetString
